{"ex-201-1":{"id":"ex-201-1","chapter":"201","number":1,"title":"計算位移","question":"<p>一輛汽車沿圖中路徑從 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點駛至 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點。</p><p>(a) 求汽車的總移動距離。</p><p>(b) 求汽車的總位移。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/1f7e4252d7714e3191a4ff84.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:201.6px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 總移動距離</p><p>= 1 + 2 + 2 + 3 + 1</p><p>= 9 km</p><p>(b) 量值：</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{2^{2} + 5^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 5.39 km</p><p>方向：</p><p>tan θ = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{5}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>θ = 68.2°</p><p>總位移是 5.39 km，向 N 68.2°E。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/52993690a81d2363c012d261.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:161.3px\"/></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/d025495ba8f482a9076cc864.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:183.6px\"/></p>","tips":"","think":"<p>如果另一輛汽車從 A 前往 B，移動距離等於總位移的大小，它應沿甚麼路徑行駛？</p>","thinkAnswer":"<p>它必須沿 A 至 B 的直線直接行駛，途中不反向。此時移動距離就是 AB 的長度 5.39 km，方向為 N68.2°E。</p>","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_201_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"78acb1baddd5d36ae775f28d6b06ca6c8a7530909d755391f35441f534446238","segments":[{"page":9,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718741,562.4491,198.81585693359375],"text":"例 題 1 計算位移\r\n一輛汽車沿圖中路徑從 A 點駛至 B 點。\r\n(a) 求汽車的總移動距離。\r\n(b) 求汽車的總位移。\r\n"},{"page":9,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,198.81585693359375,562.4491,462.3528951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 總移動距離\r\n = 1 + 2 + 2 + 3 + 1 \r\n = 9 km\r\n(b) 量值：\r\nAB = • \r\n22 + 52 = 5.39 km\r\n方向：\r\n tan θ = 5\r\n2\r\n θ = 68.2°\r\n總位移是 5.39 km，向 N 68.2°E。\r\nA\r\nB\r\nθ\r\nN\r\n5\r\n2\r\n1 km\r\n1 km\r\nA\r\nB\r\nN\r\n1\r\n1\r\n2\r\n2\r\n3\r\nB\r\nA\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":"Complete Chinese translation of the English supplementary answer","englishAlignedFields":["tips","think","thinkAnswer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-201-2":{"id":"ex-201-2","chapter":"201","number":2,"title":"平均速率與車速限制","question":"<p>一輛汽車用 10 分鐘行駛了 7.2 km。</p><p>(a) 求汽車的平均速率，答案以 km h<sup>–1</sup> 表示。</p><p>(b) 汽車所使用的道路，車速限制是 80 km h<sup>–1</sup>。根據 (a) 部的答案，能否推斷出司機有沒有遵守車速限制？</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 平均速率 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{d}{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>7.2</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{7.2}{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>60</p><p>= 43.2 km h<sup>–1</sup></p><p>(b) 不能。</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>應把以 min 表示的時間換算成 h：</p><p>10 min = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> h</p><p>提示</p><p>根據已知資料，無法確定汽車在任何瞬間的瞬時速率是否超過車速限制。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_201_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"78acb1baddd5d36ae775f28d6b06ca6c8a7530909d755391f35441f534446238","segments":[{"page":13,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,188.7798951171875,562.4491,328.0959777832031],"text":"例 題 2 平均速率與車速限制\r\n一輛汽車用 10 分鐘行駛了 7.2 km。\r\n(a) 求汽車的平均速率，答案以 km h–1 表示。\r\n(b) 汽車所使用的道路，車速限制是 80 km h–1。根據 (a) 部的答案，\r\n能否推斷出司機有沒有遵守車速限制？\r\n"},{"page":13,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,328.0959777832031,562.4491,491.6328951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 平均速率 = d\r\nt\r\n \r\n= 7.2 \r\n10\r\n60\r\n = 43.2 km h–1\r\n(b) 不能。\r\n"},{"page":13,"kind":"tips","box":[40,184.7798951171875,181.4491,491.6328951171875],"text":"提提你\r\n題目中的時間以分鐘為單\r\n位，須 把 它 轉 換 為 小 時\r\n(h)：\r\n10 分鐘 = 10\r\n60\r\n小時 (h)\r\n提提你\r\n根據題目中的資料，無法確\r\n定汽車的瞬時速率有沒有在\r\n任何一刻超過車速限制。"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-201-3":{"id":"ex-201-3","chapter":"201","number":3,"title":"平均速率和平均速度","question":"<p>單車向北行駛 800 m 後，再向西行駛 600 m，整個過程用了 400 s。</p><p>(a) 求它的平均速率。</p><p>(b) 求它的平均速度。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 平均速率 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{d}{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>800</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>600</mn></mrow><mn>400</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{800 + 600}{400}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= 3.5 m s<sup>–1</sup></p><p>(b) 量值：</p><p>總位移的量值 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>800</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>600</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{800^{2} + 600^{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1000 m</p><p>平均速度的量值 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{s}{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1000</mn><mn>400</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1000}{400}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 2.5 m s<sup>–1</sup></p><p>方向：</p><p>tan θ = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>600</mn><mn>800</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{600}{800}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>θ = 36.9° 平均速度是 2.5 m s<sup>–1</sup>，向 N 36.9°W。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/91c99ea817af33bc7252168e.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:110.9px\"/></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/5672590cd9160fa670fc53e2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:114.8px\"/></p>","tips":"<p>技巧</p><p>解難</p><p>求平均速度：</p><p class=\"numbered-step\">① 畫出物體的路徑。</p><p class=\"numbered-step\">② 畫出總位移，即由初位置指向末位置的箭頭。</p><p class=\"numbered-step\">③ 求平均速度的量值和方向。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_201_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"78acb1baddd5d36ae775f28d6b06ca6c8a7530909d755391f35441f534446238","segments":[{"page":16,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,53.49989511718741,557.4491,176.81585693359375],"text":"例 題 3 平均速率和平均速度\r\n單車向北行駛 800 m 後，再向西行駛 600 m，整個過程用了 400 s。\r\n(a) 求它的平均速率。\r\n(b) 求它的平均速度。\r\n"},{"page":16,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,176.81585693359375,557.4491,471.3528951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 平均速率 = d\r\nt\r\n = 800 + 600\r\n400\r\n= 3.5 m s–1\r\n(b) 量值：\r\n總位移的量值 = • \r\n8002 + 6002 = 1000 m\r\n平均速度的量值 = s\r\nt\r\n = 1000\r\n400\r\n = 2.5 m s–1\r\n方向：\r\n tan θ = 600\r\n800\r\n θ = 36.9°\r\n平均速度是 2.5 m s–1，向 N 36.9°W。\r\nN\r\n600 m\r\n800 m\r\nθ\r\nN\r\n600 m\r\n800 m\r\n"},{"page":16,"kind":"tips","box":[40,49.49989511718741,176.4491,471.3528951171875],"text":"計算平均速度\r\n依照以下步驟來計算平\r\n均速度。\r\n① 畫出物體的路徑。\r\n② 畫出總位移（從起點\r\n到終點的箭號）。\r\n③ 計算平均速度的量值\r\n和方向。\r\n技巧分析\r\n解 難\r\n技巧分析\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-201-4":{"id":"ex-201-4","chapter":"201","number":4,"title":"勻速運動","question":"<p>下圖顯示物體 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span>（以 • 表示）和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span>（以 × 表示）在時間 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0、1 s、2 s 和 3 s 的位置。</p><p>上述哪一個物體所作的是勻速運動？解釋原因。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/5e5f8c46bf6bd870cb21ec0e.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:256.9px\"/></p>","answer":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 所作的是勻速運動，因為它的速度恆定不變。</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>X 每秒移動的距離相同，並一直沿同一方向運動。另一方面，Y 每秒移動的距離逐漸增加，顯示它正在加速。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_201_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"78acb1baddd5d36ae775f28d6b06ca6c8a7530909d755391f35441f534446238","segments":[{"page":20,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,499.35989511718753,557.4491,682.8329925537109],"text":"例 題 4 勻速運動\r\n下圖顯示物體 X（以 • 表示）和 Y（以 × 表示）在時間 t = 0、1 s、2 s\r\n和 3 s 的位置。\r\n0 X\r\nY\r\n1 s 2 s 3 s\r\n0 1 s 2 s 3 s\r\n上述哪一個物體所作的是勻速運動？解釋原因。\r\n"},{"page":20,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,682.8329925537109,557.4491,743.3698951171875],"text":"題 解\r\nX 所作的是勻速運動，因為它的速度恆定不變。\r\n"},{"page":20,"kind":"tips","box":[40,495.35989511718753,176.4491,743.3698951171875],"text":"提提你\r\nX 在每一秒間的移動距離保\r\n持不變，而且一直沿同一方\r\n向移動。\r\n但是，Y 在每一秒間的移動\r\n距離不斷增加，由此可見它\r\n正在加速。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-201-5":{"id":"ex-201-5","chapter":"201","number":5,"title":"計時的百分誤差","question":"<p>雅芸打算用秒錶找出鞦韆來回擺動一次所用的時間 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span>（圖 a）。</p><p>(a) 雅芸直接用秒錶量度鞦韆來回擺動一次的時間，得出的結果是2.31 s。如果由反應時間引致的誤差是 0.4 s，由反應時間引致的的百分誤差是多少？</p><p>(b) 然後，她再用秒錶量度鞦韆來回擺動 10 次的時間，得出的結果是22.48 s。由反應時間引致的誤差依然是 0.4 s。</p><p>(i) 根據這次的量度結果，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的數值是多少？</p><p>(ii) 這次，由反應時間引致的百分誤差是多少？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/dba43733eb9df6d5c14ecdc0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:355.3px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 百分誤差 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>0.4</mn><mn>2.31</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{0.4}{2.31}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 100% = 17.3%</p><p>(b) (i) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>22.48</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{22.48}{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 2.25 s</p><p>(ii) 百分誤差 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>0.4</mn><mn>22.48</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{0.4}{22.48}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 100% = 1.78%</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_201_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"78acb1baddd5d36ae775f28d6b06ca6c8a7530909d755391f35441f534446238","segments":[{"page":25,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718741,564.4491,373.80859375],"text":"例 題 5 計時的百分誤差\r\n雅芸打算用秒錶找出鞦韆來回擺動一次所用的時間 T（圖 a）。\r\n(a) 雅芸直接用秒錶量度鞦韆來回擺動一次的時間，得出的結果是\r\n2.31 s。如果由反應時間引致的誤差是 0.4 s，由反應時間引致的\r\n的百分誤差是多少？\r\n(b) 然後，她再用秒錶量度鞦韆來回擺動 10 次的時間，得出的結果是\r\n22.48 s。由反應時間引致的誤差依然是 0.4 s。\r\n (i) 根據這次的量度結果，T 的數值是多少？\r\n (ii) 這次，由反應時間引致的百分誤差是多少？\r\n"},{"page":25,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,373.80859375,564.4491,517.8688951171874],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 百分誤差 = 0.4\r\n2.31\r\n× 100% = 17.3%\r\n(b) (i) T = 22.48\r\n10\r\n = 2.25 s\r\n (ii) 百分誤差 = 0.4\r\n22.48\r\n× 100% = 1.78%\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-201-6":{"id":"ex-201-6","chapter":"201","number":6,"title":"量度結果的百分誤差","question":"<p>恆輝量度一個物件的長度，所得結果為 19.1 cm，不確定度為±0.1 cm。這個量度結果的最大百分誤差是多少？</p>","answer":"<p>最大誤差 = 0.1 cm</p><p>最大百分誤差 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>0.1</mn><mn>19.1</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{0.1}{19.1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 100% = 0.524%</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>測量不確定度的絕對值就是最大誤差。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_201_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"78acb1baddd5d36ae775f28d6b06ca6c8a7530909d755391f35441f534446238","segments":[{"page":27,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718752,562.4491,148.81585693359375],"text":"例 題 6 量度結果的百分誤差\r\n恆 輝 量 度 一 個 物 件 的 長 度，所 得 結 果 為 19.1 cm，不 確 定 度 為\r\n±0.1 cm。這個量度結果的最大百分誤差是多少？\r\n"},{"page":27,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,148.81585693359375,562.4491,237.6828951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n最大誤差 = 0.1 cm\r\n最大百分誤差 = 0.1\r\n19.1\r\n× 100% = 0.524%\r\n"},{"page":27,"kind":"tips","box":[40,49.49989511718752,181.4491,237.6828951171875],"text":"提提你\r\n不確定度的絕對值就是量度\r\n結果的最大誤差。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-201-7":{"id":"ex-201-7","chapter":"201","number":7,"title":"降低百分誤差","question":"<p>在某個實驗中出現了 9 個排成一直線的光點，光點平均分佈，相鄰光點之間的距離是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span>。逸峯和凱晴打算量度 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的數值。</p><p>(a) 逸峯用直尺直接量度 2 個光點之間的距離，所得結果為 4 mm，不確定度為 ±1 mm。這個量度結果的最大百分誤差是多少？</p><p>(b) 凱晴用同一把直尺量度首尾兩個光點之間的總距離，所得結果為30 mm，不確定度為 ±1 mm。</p><p>(i) 根據她的量度結果，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的數值是多少？</p><p>(ii) 這個量度結果的最大百分誤差是多少？</p><p>(iii) 根據她的量度結果，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的最大誤差是多少？</p><p>(c) 誰所得的 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span> 值較準確？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/2f607bc65dc637ebce28200a.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:398.7px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 最大百分誤差 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 100% = 25%</p><p>(b) (i) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>30</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{30}{8}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 3.75 mm</p><p>(ii) 最大百分誤差 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>30</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{30}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 100% = 3.33%</p><p>(iii) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的最大誤差 = 3.75 × 3.33% = 0.125 mm</p><p>(c) 凱晴</p>","tips":"<p>技巧</p><p>實驗</p><p>測量誤差：所有測量都有誤差。要判斷誤差對測量的影響程度，應考慮百分誤差，而非只看誤差的大小。百分誤差越小，測量值便越準確。</p><p>提示</p><p>x 的最大百分誤差與測量的最大百分誤差相同。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_201_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"78acb1baddd5d36ae775f28d6b06ca6c8a7530909d755391f35441f534446238","segments":[{"page":27,"kind":"question","box":[185.6491,248.42989511718747,562.6491,559.048095703125],"text":"例 題 7 降低百分誤差\r\n在某個實驗中出現了 9 個排成一直線的光點，光點平均分佈，相鄰光\r\n點之間的距離是 x。逸峯和凱晴打算量度 x 的數值。\r\nx\r\n光點\r\n(a) 逸峯用直尺直接量度 2 個光點之間的距離，所得結果為 4 mm，不\r\n確定度為 ±1 mm。這個量度結果的最大百分誤差是多少？\r\n(b) 凱晴用同一把直尺量度首尾兩個光點之間的總距離，所得結果為\r\n30 mm，不確定度為 ±1 mm。\r\n (i) 根據她的量度結果，x 的數值是多少？\r\n (ii) 這個量度結果的最大百分誤差是多少？\r\n (iii) 根據她的量度結果，x 的最大誤差是多少？\r\n(c) 誰所得的 x 值較準確？\r\n"},{"page":27,"kind":"answer","box":[185.6491,559.048095703125,562.6491,743.5848951171876],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 最大百分誤差 = 1\r\n4\r\n× 100% = 25%\r\n(b) (i) x = 30\r\n8\r\n = 3.75 mm\r\n (ii) 最大百分誤差 = 1\r\n30\r\n× 100% = 3.33%\r\n (iii) x 的最大誤差 = 3.75 × 3.33% = 0.125 mm\r\n(c) 凱晴\r\n"},{"page":27,"kind":"tips","box":[40,244.42989511718747,181.6491,743.5848951171876],"text":"量度結果的誤差\r\n任何量度結果都有誤\r\n差。要 顯 示 誤 差 對 量\r\n度結果的影響有多大，\r\n應考慮百分誤差，而非\r\n誤差的值。百分誤差愈\r\n小，量度結果愈準確。\r\n技巧分析\r\n實 驗\r\n技巧分析\r\n提提你\r\nx 的最大百分誤差與量度結\r\n果的相同。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}